<title>USA: Springfield, Ill., $21 mln bonds postponed-Merrill.</title>
<headline>Springfield, Ill., $21 mln bonds postponed-Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said Thursday it will not price Springfield, Ill.'s $21.3 million general obligation bond issue this week as planned.</p>
<p>The firm said it may price the deal at the beginning of next week instead.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
